Background-removed portraits go here, named with the same slug as the
portrait in ../<slug>.<ext> — e.g. ../ziad-essam.jpg → ziad-essam.png.

Dropping a file in here switches that member's card from the
grayscale→colour hover to the blue-backdrop cut-out reveal. No code change.
Deleting it reverts the card. See src/data/team.ts → memberCutout().
